5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to check the frontage measurements first.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Space dictates how we manage the daily flow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,But who pays for the new shelter? I worry about the cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
