9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I want to know the hours this arrangement will demand of us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, costs matter, but fairness in placement matters more to me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
