35,2,1,talk,May,,The measurements show one driveway blocks most of its width.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, that explains the friction. The logs show the gate-side house files most complaints.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@May, the subsidy covers forty percent, but the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the minutes show the station block argued over the latch within two years.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the filing rules say a permanent build needs five signatures and four months.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mizuki, so the gate-side house is already carrying the noise and the smell.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, exactly. If we just move the bins, we just move the resentment.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, four months is a long time. The ledger fees keep piling up meanwhile.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, the statements say nobody wants to be the one to say no to a neighbour.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the admin load is real. I want to know the truck arrival time to plan the mornings.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,I want a plan that doesn't leave one person with the gate and the grime.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, the truck comes at seven. If we stagger the mornings, we avoid the pile-up.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, staggering means someone is always first. The ledger shows the first one pays for the mess.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the minutes show they argued over the latch. We need a shared rule, not a shared burden.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Mizuki, if we rotate the mornings, the hours are spread. I can handle the filing if we agree on the site.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I’m not signing anything that quietly leaves the gate-side house with the worst of it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I agree. The daily walk past the bins is the real test.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, if the subsidy covers the build, the ledger fees drop. That’s the win.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the statements show people want to keep talking. A shared rule keeps the door open.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the filing is a one-time cost. The hours are the daily cost. I’ll take the filing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
